{
  "about": "Framework of the new-project wizard (DECISIONS.md D-83): a base and the additions combined with it. Official instructions, versions checked on npm, Packagist and GitHub on 15/10/2026. Every base with a web interface but the CMS has the CSS frameworks (slot css); development goes through Vite or its equivalent (Turbopack for Next.js). env: variables written in .env before the steps ({name}, {package} filled in). database (of a base or of an addition): a server of the kit (mariadb, mongodb) where the project gets its database, its connection written in .env, before the steps; the steps get it as $env:DEVKIT_DB_HOST, _PORT, _NAME, _USER, _PASSWORD, _URL, and the variables of .env too ({password} = a new password, DECISIONS.md D-93). Each line is one command run with the kit's PowerShell and environment: 'create' in projects\\ (it makes the folder {name}), 'steps' inside projects\\{name}. {name} = project name, {package} = com.example.<name in lower case letters and digits>. needs: components of the kit, installed first. actions: name and command, saved as the project's actions. An addition has one entry in 'on' per base it works with: its 'create' replaces the base's (a starter kit, a template), its steps come after the base's, its actions replace those of the base with the same name. Two additions of the same 'slot' do not go together. desc and note: Italian, translated by i18n/catalog.json.",
  "pieces": [
    {
      "id": "laravel",
      "kind": "base",
      "name": "Laravel",
      "desc": "Framework PHP per applicazioni web",
      "home": "https://laravel.com/docs/13.x/installation",
      "needs": [
        "php",
        "node"
      ],
      "create": [
        "composer create-project laravel/laravel:^13.0 {name} --prefer-dist"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "npm install"
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "name": "Avvia",
          "command": "composer run dev"
        },
        {
          "name": "Prove",
          "command": "php artisan test"
        }
      ],
      "env": [
        {
          "key": "APP_NAME",
          "value": "{name}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "symfony",
      "kind": "base",
      "name": "Symfony",
      "desc": "Framework PHP per applicazioni web",
      "home": "https://symfony.com/doc/current/setup.html",
      "needs": [
        "php"
      ],
      "create": [
        "composer create-project symfony/skeleton:^8.1 {name}"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "composer require webapp --no-interaction"
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "name": "Avvia",
          "command": "php -S 127.0.0.1:8000 -t public"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
